{
  "_comment": "Antigravity (agy) permission baseline. Merged by setup.sh into ~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/settings.json via claude/scripts/agy-apply-permissions.py (that file also holds trustedWorkspaces and per-machine grants, so it is never symlinked). Rules are word-by-word prefixes unless regex:. Precedence: deny > ask > allow. With toolPermission=proceed-in-sandbox every sandboxed command auto-runs; the allow list matters when the sandbox is off. Every read-only command(...) has a matching unsandboxed(...) so a command the sandbox cannot serve (paths outside the workspace, network) does not turn into a prompt; code runners (python3, bun run) stay sandbox-only. read_file/write_file rules may start with ~/ \u2014 the merge script expands it to the machine's home.",
